# Conformance probe pack for ruling 23 of spec 0.9 on the `xml` wire. Public.
# Two lines name the attribute `s`: the first carries a sentinel, the second
# none, and a line for `x` lies between them. When the first line's key is
# absent and the second's present, the attribute is written at the position
# of the first line, before `x`.
format  conformance-absent-place-xml
version 0.9.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    xml
root    msg
field   probe.s1  @s  string  absent -
field   probe.x   @x  int
field   probe.s2  @s  string
